WEBVTT

NOTE Klinik Putrijaya prediabetes video. Script: november-brief.md (Iman). Source: US CDC. Timed to audio/voice.wav (Microsoft Zira Desktop, rate -1).

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Did you know your blood sugar can be high…

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.645
without you feeling it?

3
00:00:04.845 --> 00:00:07.065
That's called prediabetes.

4
00:00:07.065 --> 00:00:12.463
Your blood sugar is higher than normal, but not yet type 2 diabetes.

5
00:00:12.663 --> 00:00:16.186
You can have it for years, with no clear symptoms.

6
00:00:16.386 --> 00:00:20.506
Your risk is higher if you're overweight, 45 or older,

7
00:00:20.506 --> 00:00:24.896
or have a parent, brother or sister with type 2 diabetes.

8
00:00:25.096 --> 00:00:26.456
The good news?

9
00:00:26.456 --> 00:00:31.136
Healthy changes can cut your risk of type 2 diabetes in half.

10
00:00:31.336 --> 00:00:35.636
Try at least 150 minutes of brisk walking a week.

11
00:00:35.636 --> 00:00:39.713
Losing just 5 to 7 percent of your weight helps too.

12
00:00:39.913 --> 00:00:43.496
And a simple blood sugar test can tell you where you stand.

13
00:00:43.696 --> 00:00:47.026
Get your blood sugar checked at Klinik Putrijaya.

14
00:00:47.026 --> 00:00:48.703
See you soon!
